re.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,L,A,D\\in V,\\quad A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathcal M,L,A,D\\in V,\\quad A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"170713b2aedf2fd0\" href=\"?note=170713b2aedf2fd0\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S(D,\\mathcal M,L,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land D=\\left\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M):\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\varphi,x,\\bar a)\\land\\forall y\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\varphi,y,\\bar a)\\to y=x)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S(D,\\mathcal M,L,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land D=\\left\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M):\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\varphi,x,\\bar a)\\land\\forall y\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\varphi,y,\\bar a)\\to y=x)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Formula well-formedness, genuine assignments for the parameter tuple, and uniqueness inside the structure carrier are explicit.</li>\n<li>The model2 and model8 definable-closure variants are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"170713b2aedf2fd0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"170713b2aedf2fd0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-logic-algebraic-closure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,L,A,D\\in V,\\quad A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S(D,\\mathcal M,L,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land D=\\left\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M):\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in A^{<\\omega}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\varphi,x,\\bar a)\\land\\forall y\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;(\\mathrm{TupleSat}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\varphi,y,\\bar a)\\to y=x)\\right)\\right\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1617,"backlinks":[{"id":"ebbc02d2d7c7fc7f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2717","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure.md|58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","65418b505fc53093","d9b8711cda3f31ca","170713b2aedf2fd0"]}